      "text": "Draw a circle with centre O through J2. Draw a circle with centre M1 through J2. Draw a circle with centre M2 through J2. Draw a circle with centre M3 through J4. Draw a circle with centre M4 through J4.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Draw a circle with centre O through J2. Draw a circle with centre M1 through J2. Draw a circle with centre M2 through J2. Draw a circle with centre M3 through J4. Draw a circle with centre M4 through J4.",
