    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Join K1, K2, K3 and K4 with straight lines. They are where the circle at O crosses the lines through NE and NW. Draw a horizontal line and a vertical line through R1 and through R2. R1 and R2 are where the circle at M1 crosses the line through NE. Do the same through R3 and R4, on the circle at M3.",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Join K1, K2, K3 and K4 with straight lines. They are where the circle at O crosses the lines through NE and NW. Draw a horizontal line and a vertical line through R1 and through R2. R1 and R2 are where the circle at M1 crosses the line through NE. Do the same through R3 and R4, on the circle at M3.",
